[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3581427341","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113188#issuecomment-3581427341","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113188","id":3581427341,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7VeD6N","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-26T13:53:39Z","updated_at":"2025-11-26T13:53:39Z","body":"Looking at the cherry-picks for 4.5.1 I can't find anything that's clearly related to this, but since it happens in 4.5.1 and not in 4.5 it has to be in one of those changes, so should be easy to find the cause of the regression","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3581427341/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3582142356","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113188#issuecomment-3582142356","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113188","id":3582142356,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7VgyeU","user":{"login":"Chestnut45","id":48457382,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NDU3Mzgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48457382?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45","html_url":"https://github.com/Chestnut45","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-26T16:28:08Z","updated_at":"2025-11-26T16:28:08Z","body":"I had a few more minutes available to test and was able to confirm it happens as early as 4.5.1-rc1 so that should narrow down a little bit more... I'm suspicious of #106798 in particular as the commit it reverts was to fix delayed input events. I'll test if re-adding the second pending events check fixes it later tonight if I get a chance.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3582142356/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3582357618","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113188#issuecomment-3582357618","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113188","id":3582357618,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7VhnBy","user":{"login":"Chestnut45","id":48457382,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NDU3Mzgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48457382?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45","html_url":"https://github.com/Chestnut45","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-26T17:10:45Z","updated_at":"2025-11-26T17:21:05Z","body":"Unfortunately confirmed. Re-adding that pending events check fixes it entirely (at least from the 4.5.1-stable branch). I'll do some thinking about how to solve the input stability issue without re-introducing that x11 crash.\n\nEdit: 112515 Does not fix this either. Will keep thinking.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3582357618/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3583397015","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113188#issuecomment-3583397015","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113188","id":3583397015,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7VlkyX","user":{"login":"Chestnut45","id":48457382,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NDU3Mzgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48457382?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45","html_url":"https://github.com/Chestnut45","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-26T22:17:26Z","updated_at":"2025-11-26T22:17:26Z","body":"Hmm, leaving the second event check in and leaving the MRP to run for about half an hour on both wayland and x11 native, I can't seem to get the crash to happen. I understand that it's pretty inconsistent to try to reproduce, but I do have libx11 version 1.8.7, which should be one of the versions affected. I'll keep trying to find an MRP for the crash, but in the meantime, here's a better MRP for this issue to show the mouse motion jitter without requiring you to move the mouse manually (just press the space bar to toggle the mouse automatically spinning in a circle once per second to simulate smooth motion).\n\n[mrp_autospin.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23780575/mrp_autospin.zip)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3583397015/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3590075859","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113188#issuecomment-3590075859","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113188","id":3590075859,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7V_DXT","user":{"login":"YashwanthCB","id":22799310,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzk5MzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22799310?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB","html_url":"https://github.com/YashwanthCB","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-28T18:13:23Z","updated_at":"2025-11-28T18:13:23Z","body":"Is it not happening in Windows?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3590075859/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3593846416","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113188#issuecomment-3593846416","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113188","id":3593846416,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7WNb6Q","user":{"login":"Chestnut45","id":48457382,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NDU3Mzgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48457382?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45","html_url":"https://github.com/Chestnut45","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-30T23:30:03Z","updated_at":"2025-12-01T01:18:34Z","body":"> Is it not happening in Windows?\n\nWas just able to test MRP with 4.5.1-stable on a windows machine today, and this issue is not present.\n\nSeems to be specifically the change to `platform/linuxbsd/x11/display_server_x11.cpp` to remove the extra `_check_pending_events(events);` toward the beginning of `DisplayServerX11::process_events()` which is a workaround for a crash on some versions of x11. In my opinion if we can't pinpoint the crash and fix it properly (and it seems very likely to be an x11 issue), we'll need to find a better workaround, because this makes relative mouse motion completely unusable for the majority of Linux users (even on versions of x11 that don't suffer from the crash, it seems?)\n\nI'll keep investigating tonight on a different PC to see if I get luckier trying to repro the crash...","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3593846416/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3596768183","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113188#issuecomment-3596768183","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113188","id":3596768183,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7WYlO3","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-01T14:14:07Z","updated_at":"2025-12-01T14:14:07Z","body":"Can reproduce this in 4.5.1 as well. My specs: `Godot v4.5.1.stable - Zorin OS 18 18 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated Intel(R) HD Graphics 5500 (BDW GT2) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i3-5005U CPU @ 2.00GHz (4 threads) - 7.67 GiB memory`","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3596768183/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3598459875","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113188#issuecomment-3598459875","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113188","id":3598459875,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7WfCPj","user":{"login":"Chestnut45","id":48457382,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NDU3Mzgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48457382?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45","html_url":"https://github.com/Chestnut45","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-01T19:18:31Z","updated_at":"2025-12-01T19:31:46Z","body":"I might have something here! I was able to get the stuttering issue to completely disappear *without* checking for pending events on the main thread(!) during `process_events()`, by simply lowering the timeout in `DisplayServerX11::_wait_for_events()`, which is called in a loop by `events_thread`.\n\nI'm in class right now, but changing the timeout from 1 second to 10,000 microseconds removed the issue on my laptop (specs from original issue).\n\n<img width=\"703\" height=\"300\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9ba93a60-c4ca-4122-a228-8589a4001975\" />\n\nI'm sure there is some performance considerations to take into account when choosing the best timeout value since the input thread will be polling more often even without receiving events (probably more battery drain, etc.), but this is very promising and doesn't seem to re-introduce the x11 crash.\n\nLater tonight I'll do some more testing to find a reasonable value and see about opening a PR with the fix, though I would love for somebody who could repro the original crash to verify that lowering this timeout doesn't somehow cause the same race condition they were finding previously.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3598459875/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3599125380","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113188#issuecomment-3599125380","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113188","id":3599125380,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7WhkuE","user":{"login":"Chestnut45","id":48457382,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NDU3Mzgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48457382?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45","html_url":"https://github.com/Chestnut45","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-01T21:54:06Z","updated_at":"2025-12-03T02:34:26Z","body":"I've started testing the potential fix on a fork from master now, and as I suspected, the optimal value for the timeout depends on framerate. Intuitively, the timeout should be less than 1,000,000 / fps microseconds to avoid missing events for the current frame, but in practice it seems the timeout must be some amount lower than that as well to account for extra time spent during `_check_pending_events()`, mutex handling, etc.\n\nAt 60hz, a timeout of 16,666us greatly reduces the stutter, and a timeout of 10,000us seems to eliminate it entirely.\n\nAt 144hz, a timeout of 10,000us still shows significant stutter, 6,944us gives a reduction, and <4,000us seems to eliminate it entirely.\n\n~~At either refresh rate, a timeout of 0 seems to eliminate the issue entirely.~~ *...but causes CPU usage to max out on the event thread, so not a viable solution*\n\nAll of this testing was done with these specs:\n`Godot v4.6.dev (f5918a9d3) - Ubuntu 24.04.3 LTS 24.04 on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 Ti Laptop GPU - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-12700H (20 threads) - 15.30 GiB memory`\n\nI now think the best option is to change the timeout to somewhere around 1,000 microseconds, as it's short enough to fix the stutter completely up to fairly high refresh rates (should work to at least 240hz but I only have up to 144hz to test with), and doesn't noticeably change the CPU usage. I'll do some final tests and open a PR with this change in the coming days.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3599125380/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3628532515","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113188#issuecomment-3628532515","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113188","id":3628532515,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7YRwMj","user":{"login":"Chestnut45","id":48457382,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NDU3Mzgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48457382?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45","html_url":"https://github.com/Chestnut45","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-08T18:43:33Z","updated_at":"2025-12-08T18:43:33Z","body":"Just wanted to add some more findings, if you have a relatively high polling rate mouse (1000hz+), you may have difficulty reproducing the stutter, since input events are sent quickly enough to avoid the event thread ever sleeping for long enough to cause the issue. I just found that moving the mouse manually with a g502 I could not reproduce the stutter, while using the built-in trackpad (even in the same running project) stutters constantly.\n\nThis behaviour essentially confirms that the issue is that we're allowing the event thread to sleep for too long, and reducing the timeout is the proper way to fix it.\n\nIn theory, it should wake up whenever a new event comes, but in practice, the time between that next event becoming available and the event thread actually waking up (context switch, potential cache invalidation, scheduling latency, etc.), and then being able to grab the lock in time to complete another call to `DisplayServerX11::_check_pending_events()`, means that if the main thread grabs the lock from `DisplayServerX11::process_events()` during that time, those events are missed and have to be processed on the next frame.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3628532515/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]